  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Climate and Environment-Induced Mobility in the Arid and Semi-Arid Lands (ASALs) in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will address the basic humanitarian needs and resilience of climate change displaced persons in the Garissa and Turkana county by generating  evidence to inform displacement and mobility dynamics of displaced populations through flow monitoring, mobility tracking, and multi-sectoral assessments that inform and provide Inclusive climate-resilient and adaptive interventions for displaced people and host communities living in fragile eco-systems.</narrative>
  </description>
